<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 7.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 7.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, April 74 on Friday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.04.97	  04.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.5616	 6.5550</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3922	 2.3903</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6574	 4.6494</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2349	 3.2585</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5263	 0.5227</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7981	 0.7966</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2990	 0.2987</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.9150	 6.9103</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6967	 0.6965</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3021	 1.3007</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
